{"3805410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Night of the Extinct", "steam_appid": 3805410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>This is a &quot;pilot&quot; game of sorts to see if you guys like what we're doing and if you want more!  Please leave a review with your highlights and your criticisms, it's a tremendous help.</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Silvercity Sharks and ArtOfGerald are collaborating to bring you a new horror experience... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back in time and see the creatures of yesterday, but you might be doing more than just seeing. These creatures come to life at night, and it's your job to survive your time here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Become the eyes of a mid-2010s paranormal content creator named Elliot, who has challenged himself to stay overnight at an allegedly haunted museum. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new friends that'll talk your ear off and enemies that will stalk you down to your death. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the museum and see what sights are offered, with real descriptions of the items! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse your way through the establishment by completing security checks with PHYSICS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the secrets of the National Museum of Paleontology through different routes...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WITH VOICE ACTING, ACHIEVEMENTS, and TRANSLATED INTO 13 LANGUAGES!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will YOU make it out alive?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805410/extras/2c520f005e4f7f2c7564a8f23754d476.poster.avif?t=1763917048\" width=736 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805410/extras/2c520f005e4f7f2c7564a8f23754d476.webm?t=1763917048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805410/extras/2c520f005e4f7f2c7564a8f23754d476.mp4?t=1763917048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>This is a &quot;pilot&quot; game of sorts to see if you guys like what we're doing and if you want more!  Please leave a review with your highlights and your criticisms, it's a tremendous help.</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Silvercity Sharks and ArtOfGerald are collaborating to bring you a new horror experience... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back in time and see the creatures of yesterday, but you might be doing more than just seeing. These creatures come to life at night, and it's your job to survive your time here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Become the eyes of a mid-2010s paranormal content creator named Elliot, who has challenged himself to stay overnight at an allegedly haunted museum. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new friends that'll talk your ear off and enemies that will stalk you down to your death. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the museum and see what sights are offered, with real descriptions of the items! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse your way through the establishment by completing security checks with PHYSICS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the secrets of the National Museum of Paleontology through different routes...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WITH VOICE ACTING, ACHIEVEMENTS, and TRANSLATED INTO 13 LANGUAGES!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will YOU make it out alive?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805410/extras/2c520f005e4f7f2c7564a8f23754d476.poster.avif?t=1763917048\" width=736 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805410/extras/2c520f005e4f7f2c7564a8f23754d476.webm?t=1763917048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805410/extras/2c520f005e4f7f2c7564a8f23754d476.mp4?t=1763917048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Become the eyes of a mid-2010s paranormal content creator, who has challenged himself to stay overnight at an allegedly haunted museum. Will he make it out alive?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Italian, Danish, Dutch, Romanian, Russian, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805410/7f0b6bb8dcc51d235311eabe598ba61aa4471cec/header.jpg?t=1763917048", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805410/b323497233f23d2e23bd3c0e54eb17e780068cb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763917048", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805410/b323497233f23d2e23bd3c0e54eb17e780068cb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763917048", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Night of the Extinct uses the Unreal® Engine. Unreal® is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnreal®